  "boundaries": [
    "Current active organization membership is the board read floor; object-specific grants/approvals/version CAS/durable action idempotency remain pending.",
    "Notification bodies are fixed generic text/null and renderer state stores IDs/read/time only; task titles and bodies are never cached or sent as OS notifications by this path.",
    "Membership revocation is rechecked on list/count/read/open. Metadata is cleared on refresh or polling; no immediate source-revocation push is claimed.",
    "Native tests execute production SQLite DDL, managers, IPC and preload with injected host identity/window/logger boundaries. Renderer tests use actual Vue/Pinia with component/IPC shell substitutes.",
    "SQLite close/reopen was tested. Abrupt process death, production SQLCipher, real Electron GUI, full production build, exact-commit OS release matrices and real tenant/business/model acceptance were not tested.",
    "Legacy WS/system/mobile transports exclude the new protected kind until they gain current source-authorized projection. This is not a general legacy notification authorization rewrite.",
    "Uncommitted and unpublished. Historical batch 15/16 evidence is preserved. Independent concurrent CLI/IDE/RRSI changes are excluded."
  ],
